# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  _redirects — Cloudflare Pages redirect rules
#
#  Replaces the two RewriteRules in .htaccess. http → https is not
#  listed because Pages upgrades it on its own.
#
#  Every canonical, hreflang and sitemap URL in this repo is apex, so
#  apex is the canonical host and www redirects into it — not the
#  other way round.
#
#  Both albertoeguerrap.com and www.albertoeguerrap.com have to be
#  attached as custom domains on the Pages project for this to fire;
#  a hostname the project does not serve never reaches these rules.
#  If the full-URL form below does not take effect once the domains
#  are attached, do it with a Redirect Rule in the dashboard instead
#  and delete this file — same result, different layer.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

https://www.albertoeguerrap.com/*  https://albertoeguerrap.com/:splat  301
